    "body": "I think this is picking up on [`dirs`](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/Cargo.lock#L317-L326) dependency in our `Cargo.lock`, this comes from [`mac-notification-sys`](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/Cargo.lock#L577-L587) which in turn is a dependency of [`notify-rust`](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/Cargo.lock#L670-L679). I'm not sure there is much we can do but I don't know if this is going to get triggered again on the next CI run.",
